==Miscellaneous==

*Game Released.
*Added [[Cat Guide]].
*Added [[Enemy Guide]]
*Added [[Catnip Challenges]].
*Added [[Normal Cat Capsule]] feature.
*Added [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] feature.
*Added Cloud Save Data via Nintendo Switch Online.
*Added the following abilities:
**Weaken, Freeze, Slow, Attacks Only, Strong Against, Tough, Massive Damage, Knockback, Strengthen, Survive, Base Destroyer, Critical, Barrier Breaker, Extra Money, Metal, Wave Attack, Immune to Weaken, Immune to Freeze, Immune to Slow, Immune to Knockback, Immune to Waves, Warp Blocker, and Wave Shield.

* Added the [[User Rank]] System,
* Introduced [[Timed Score Reward]] System.
* Added Storage feature.
* Added [[Catfruit]] feature.
